  "description": "Serafina is an elegant serif typeface inspired by 18th-century Didone. It has mixed uppercase and lowercase letters that share the same height and allows infinite combinations to give your project a unique style. Serafina is well-suited for posters, branding, logotype, headlines, titles and editorial design. Give your project a touch of luxury and class.",
